{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_billro_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_billro_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "保護者的本性",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_billro_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e119628e73b1dffe1c5a0054dfe29893a47ee8feb02976da6656af8c049265a2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcounty"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希？你還在聽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上次的治療很有成效，霍恩洛厄伯爵的身體好轉不少，這次也麻煩你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，請稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不建議你在戰鬥時分心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不算什麼戰鬥。不要緊，很快就會結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "言歸正傳......這次我會在羅德島稍微多停留一段時間，這應該沒什麼問題吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島不會拒絕幹員的停留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以直接說，歡迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你想要聽，那麼歡迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我都不知道該說你是直接還是迂回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算啦，那讓我們談談下個療程相關的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫療部將會根據你提供的體檢資料，配置下一個療程的藥劑。這本身需要一些時間，不過不會很久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我仍然堅持，伯爵本人需要定期接受詳細的檢查，這樣才能更有效地制訂治療計劃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最好是能把人帶到你們這裡檢查，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以伯爵的立場來說，這麼做的風險實在太大。可惜，如果有些人能不那麼固執，所有事情一定都會更簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，在藥劑配置完成之前，我就和安克赫娜......我家的那個小丫頭一起行動了，沒問題吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有行動自由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那真是太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，對了，還有一件事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來有幾隻害蟲嗅到蹤跡追著過來了。伯爵閣下還真是一如既往地受關注，連帶著我這個小小的侍衛也總有人盯梢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過你放心，這件事連累不到羅德島，我會妥善處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，讓我想想，該怎麼處理你們呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起羅德島那一套溫和的做法，我還是更擅長請人直接閉嘴......這樣大家都會更輕鬆點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你要幹什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位發什麼抖？既然選擇以劫掠為生，這點心理準備總該要做好的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用擔心，很快就不會痛了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，我這邊任務完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安克赫娜，你怎麼到這裡來了，那邊的人都處理好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫療幹員正在替受傷的人處理傷口，我幫忙把藥品都發好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做得好做得好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐在做什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒什麼特別的......\n只不過是和大家友好地溝通了一下而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這女人說謊！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（*簡練的哥倫比亞問候語*，去他的友好溝通！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......友好地溝通？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "友好地溝通！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾位先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在和我們說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。有了這次的教訓，大家應該就知道厲害了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請你們以後不要再去騷擾拓荒隊了，那裡的人們都很努力，也請你們好好工作吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？工作？這小丫頭在說什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗯？再說一遍？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（閉嘴，蠢貨！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哎呦！幹嘛打我......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您、您放心！我們今後一定不會再去找拓荒隊的麻煩，一定......一定好好工作！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，當然！經過兩位的教訓，我們已經悔悟了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種話，沒人會相信......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......安克赫娜？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的這樣就可以了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......還不夠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我再想想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（唉......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，按照安克赫娜你想的來處理就好，不論如何姐姐都支援你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "短髮的卡普里尼稍作停頓，一直放在妹妹身上的目光轉向一旁的劫掠者，那輕飄飄的一眼一掠而過，女人血色的眼眸中不帶有多少溫度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐？怎麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？我在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼。既然問題解決了，我們就回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她們真的走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼辦啊，老大，難不成我們真的要去工作？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這、我們能幹點啥啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹！幹你個頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趕緊去把其他人也扶起來！我們暫時先撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了！哎，怎麼又打我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_county_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，這樣暫時就沒問題了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的傷勢不是很嚴重，但最近一段時間，還是請避免過重的勞動，儘量多休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的拓荒者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，如果不儘快把這一帶的建設工程做完，那群人又會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的拓荒者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了！別說了，總有辦法的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的拓荒者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的拓荒者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心吧醫生，我們會監督傷患休息的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傷患的處理已經結束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和安克赫娜......蜜蠟已經教訓了一頓那些劫掠者，這裡還有什麼能幫上忙的地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡涅利安小姐！這次辛苦你和蜜蠟護送我們過來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "針對拓荒者們的治療部分已經結束了，外傷並不嚴重，隊伍裡的感染者之中，也沒有狀況特別危險的患者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任務本身應該可以說是已經完成了，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在擔心那些劫掠者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那群人在這一帶活動有一陣子了，看起來不太可能會因為被教訓一兩次就收手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我們畢竟只是出任務，也沒辦法一直在這裡幫忙......對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，大家都能看得出來的道理，我家的小丫頭卻還搞不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真讓人操心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......蜜蠟小姐已經很努力了！最初我和她出任務的時候，她可是迷路到第三天早上才找回營地......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？這倒是沒有聽她提起過，之後有時間我請你吃飯，我們可以詳細聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有機會的話務必！我也想給卡涅利安小姐介紹一下羅德島食堂的特色菜呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，蜜蠟小姐去哪裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她說還有點事，要一個人行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，單獨行動嗎？！應、應該不會再迷路了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，感覺有點意外，我還以為卡涅利安小姐一定會不放心地跟上去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事事都親力親為的話，孩子是沒有機會成長的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安克赫娜是出來歷練的，讓她自己多經歷一些也是好事，管太多的監護人會被討厭——話雖這麼說，擔心還是會有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以劫掠者的問題......如果不介意的話，可以交給我解決嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡涅利安小姐有什麼好辦法嗎？如果能幫上忙的話，我也可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝，不過幫忙就不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的做法......羅德島的各位或許會有些不太習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這、這是什麼意思......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，別多想，交給我就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "加入羅德島在最初只是權宜之計。\n年幼的伯爵閣下身患不光彩的病症，隱藏著感染者的身份在萊塔尼亞衣冠楚楚的上流人士間周旋。\n明明還是個孩子，舉止卻已琢磨得十分老練。\n可在卡涅利安看來，那副模樣談不上什麼體面，倒像是記憶裡曾見過的，失去雙親，自己也傷痕累累的野獸幼崽。\n面對獵人時齜牙咧嘴，炸起毛髮，偽裝出最後一絲野獸的尊嚴。\n最初只是因此，而稍微插手多管了一下閒事。\n而為此與羅德島簽署協定，也不過是在當時不得已而為之的種種中微不足道的一件罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你大晚上的在外頭晃什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我疼得睡不著覺。哎呦喂，今天那人下手真狠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都怪那個該死的女人，這一趟算是白跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等這群叫什麼羅德島的多管閒事的傢伙走了，我們再給那支拓荒隊一點教訓！看他們之後還敢不敢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還敢不敢什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好啊，諸位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來各位好像在談論什麼很有趣的話題，可否讓我也參與其中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是、你是白天的那個瘋女人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這稱呼真沒禮貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不過算了。這樣正好，如果你們突然變得禮儀周到，那我倒是也有點不好動手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想幹什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你白天答應過，會放過我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？我有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我是說了會支持安克赫娜的決定，但是放過你們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，我有說過這種話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個*下流的哥倫比亞語*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要這麼激動，先生們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難聽的粗口救不了你們，不過在解決你們之前，我還有一個小問題要請教各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可以回答你的問題，但你必須保證、保證不殺我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我不談條件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來各位還沒有搞清楚狀況，都怪我白天的時候也有點太過手下留情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的手！不、別這樣，我什麼都說，求求你放過我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......又來？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡涅利安小姐！總算是趕上了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，等一下，不可以動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，安克赫娜，你聽我說，這其中稍微有點小誤會，我和這位先生是在友好地......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是笨蛋哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐的戰鬥方式我早就知道，沒有必要瞞著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長老爺爺們都和我說了，姐姐第一次出去狩獵就滿身是血地回來，還把獵物弄得破破爛爛的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐就是做事太直接了！太粗暴了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......長老們還真是什麼都和你說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，我可以停手......但是這些傢伙，你們打算怎麼處理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放過他們，指望他們好好工作是不太可能的。就這麼放著不管的話，不知道之後他們會幹出什麼事來......我們可不是一直留在這裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，這我也知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，姐姐，這裡是哥倫比亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的意思是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，或許我們可以借用一下哥倫比亞人的規矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，蜜蠟小姐真的想得很周到，下午的時候就獨自進城辦這件事去了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞警察",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥倫比亞警隊。抱歉，我們來遲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞警察",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這群人就是通報人說的數次襲擊拓荒隊，並於這一帶暴力襲擊過往行人的劫掠者集團嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死......怎麼是這幫條子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞警察",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，原來是你們這群敗類。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們還有其他成員！警官，請跟我來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我詢問了拓荒隊的成員，這群人之前幹了不少壞事，要是被抓的話，恐怕相當長一段時間內他們都出不來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣一來，他們就不能再做壞事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這倒是......但是真虧你能想到這一點啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在老家那邊，大家是不太能想到要找治安隊啦。但博士說，要學會入鄉隨俗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還要借助能借助的一切力量......這也是博士教過我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎，那個人還教了你這些啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安克赫娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很喜歡羅德島？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以問問理由嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的大家都是很好的人，待在那裡，我可以見到很多沒有見過的事物，學到很多東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，這不就是我們出來歷練的目的嗎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的傳統，確實就是為了讓我們有機會瞭解外界，吸收那些我們感興趣的知識，見識那些我們從未見識過的事物......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是這樣過來的，現在輪到安克赫娜你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......這我很清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐？怎麼了，你......在難過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有。我高興還來不及呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，誰能想到當年那個只會抱著我的腿不放的小傢伙，現在也能講出這種有道理的話了，時間過得可真快啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過呢，沒能看到安克赫娜是怎麼變得這麼可靠的，姐姐還是有一點傷心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，回頭去找博士聊聊天吧，博士的話，應該知道不少安克赫娜的趣事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，不逗你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你做得很好，安克赫娜，我很高興能看到你在用自己的方式去處理遇到的困難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前說的話，仍然算數。不管安克赫娜你想要做什麼，姐姐都會支援你。所以不論遇到什麼事，都不要害怕，按照你想的去做就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。我知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐很快就會再次離開，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不能一直陪著你，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的。在姐姐不在的這段時間，我會繼續和羅德島一起遊歷，我還有很多東西要學......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想要變得更加可靠，下次一定就能幫上姐姐的忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，這下我真的能放心你一個人留在羅德島了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算“那邊”真的出了什麼意外，你在這裡，應該也不會有什麼危險......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總是做危險的事情還不讓我知道的姐姐是大笨蛋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？總算是把夢話說出口了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜蠟",
      "speakerId": "avg_344_beewax_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（鼓起臉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，別生氣。就像安克赫娜你已經逐漸掌握自己的行事風格一樣，你知道的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也有我的處事方式呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島容納了許許多多不同的人，有些人是因為志同道合走到一起，而更多的是像她這樣，因為各種各樣的理由而暫時聚集在這裡。\n安克赫娜能夠在這裡開拓眼界，學會思考，理解並接納羅德島的理念，卡涅利安由衷為此感到欣慰。\n儘管她本人只會按照自己的心意行動，但卡涅利安心想，若是在羅德島這些可愛的人面前，她倒是也願意稍微收斂，配合他們的行動。\n如果長期磨合的話，會不會連她也受到影響，稍微變得柔和一些呢？\n雖然這也有些令人期待，不過，在那之前......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_undergroud_u_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（確認無誤，那個卡普里尼女人確實是霍恩洛厄伯爵身邊的女侍衛。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（堂堂萊塔尼亞伯爵身邊的人，卻和一個礦石病相關的製藥企業密切接觸......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（羅德島嗎......似乎在什麼地方聽過這個公司的名字。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（總之得先把這個消息上報——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今夜第二次，晚上好，害蟲先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你是那個女侍衛——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咕......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的偽裝很不錯，差點就把我騙過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些貴族老爺還真是不嫌麻煩，連我一介小小侍衛都要派人盯梢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要瞞著安克赫娜再偷偷回來可花了我不少功夫，小丫頭現在不好糊弄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，你、難道......你們果然是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沉默是一項美好的品德，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，啊——！！我的腿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，抱歉，我是不是弄痛你了，先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來吧，告訴我你的幕後主使，我給你一個痛快，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些文明人倒是發明出來不少陰損的手段，我雖然用不太習慣，但要是你太頑固，也只有試一試了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想你應該不會想要嘗試吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的劫掠者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，啊......啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這樣就暫時沒問題了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡的情況，也得儘快報告給伯爵才行，現在的小朋友真是一個比一個不好對付。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......再不回去的話，安克赫娜估計就要起疑心了。她以前雖然敏銳，但可沒有現在這麼精明，到底是被誰影響了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，孩子的成長可真是一眨眼的工夫啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡涅利安",
      "speakerId": "avg_426_billro_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼一來，我要是不再努力一點，可不好意思就這麼回去呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "aliases": [
        "醫療幹員"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
